<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org" xmlns:sec="http://www.thymeleaf.org/extras/spring-security">
<body>
<header class="site-header" th:fragment="header(active)">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">본문 바로가기</a>
    <div class="container header-inner">
        <a class="brand" th:href="@{/}" aria-label="DebugMate 홈">
            <span class="brand-mark">D</span><span>DebugMate</span>
        </a>
        <nav class="primary-nav" aria-label="주요 메뉴">
            <a th:href="@{/}" th:classappend="${active == 'home'} ? ' active'">대시보드</a>
            <a th:href="@{/errors/new}" th:classappend="${active == 'new'} ? ' active'">오류 등록</a>
            <a th:href="@{/errors}" th:classappend="${active == 'history'} ? ' active'">해결 기록</a>
            <a th:href="@{/about}" th:classappend="${active == 'about'} ? ' active'">MVP 안내</a>
            <a sec:authorize="hasRole('ADMIN')" th:href="@{/admin/seniors}" th:classappend="${active == 'admin'} ? ' active'">시니어 승인</a>
            <a sec:authorize="isAuthenticated()" th:href="@{/profile}" th:classappend="${active == 'profile'} ? ' active'">프로필</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="account-menu" sec:authorize="isAuthenticated()">
            <span><b sec:authentication="name">user@email.com</b><small sec:authorize="hasRole('JUNIOR')">주니어</small><small sec:authorize="hasRole('SENIOR')">시니어</small><small sec:authorize="hasRole('ADMIN')">관리자</small></span>
            <form th:action="@{/logout}" method="post"><button class="text-button" type="submit">로그아웃</button></form>
        </div>
        <div class="account-menu" sec:authorize="isAnonymous()">
            <a class="button secondary compact" th:href="@{/login}">로그인</a>
            <a class="button primary compact" th:href="@{/signup}">회원가입</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="profile-setup-modal" th:if="${profileSetupRequired}" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="profile-setup-title" aria-modal="true">
        <div class="profile-setup-card">
            <p class="eyebrow">PROFILE SETUP</p>
            <h2 id="profile-setup-title">프로필을 먼저 완성해 주세요</h2>
            <p>개발 경험과 관심 분야를 등록하면 이후 개발자 탐색과 소통 기능을 더 정확하게 이용할 수 있어요.</p>
            <a class="button primary" th:href="@{/profile}">프로필 설정하기</a>
        </div>
    </aside>
</header>

<footer class="site-footer" th:fragment="footer">
    <div class="container footer-inner">
        <span>DebugMate MVP</span><span>AI 연결 전 단계 · 학습과 검증 중심의 오류 관리</span>
    </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
